-mukuta-pitambara-dhari/","description":"Mayūra-mukuṭa — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Mayūra-mukuṭa. Sanskrit composition by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"mayura-mukuta-pitambara-dhari"}}